// Base permit: the schema-lookup tool is always reachable.
// AgentCore Policy is deny-by-default, so every callable tool needs a permit.
// It also matters for the temporal policies below: a denied call records only an
// ::error event, so without this permit there would never be a
// get_tables_information::response in the session history to match.
permit(
  principal,
  action == AgentCore::Action::"DatabaseToolsTarget___get_tables_information",
  resource == AgentCore::Gateway::"{{GATEWAY_ARN}}"
);
